    "Transparent albedo (props atlas, logo B, catch fence) is UASTC, not ETC1S, because ETC1S fringes alpha.",
    "Logo B Hammer Yellow and the sky hexes are ungraded. All other albedos are also ungraded; runtime applies the shared grade.",
    "Hero still is hero/hometown_hero_r4.png (1920x1080, same framing as r2/r3). Follow cam is hero/hometown_followcam_r4.png (2340x1080 at 22 px/m). r1\u2013r3 kept.",
    "Infield inside the oval is dirt (dirt_infield). No grass in the infield except logo B. grass_* maps stay on disk but are unused for the infield; grass remains outside the track and at the pits / corn edge per tracks_spec.",
    "Stand sprite in the hero/follow-cam is bleachers_crowd (seated low-poly spectators). Empty bleachers remain in the props atlas.",
    "Wall has a sponsor-free dusk navy / cream / Hammer Yellow identity band. Heights remain Physics PR #88: 1.2 m wall, 3.0 m catch fence.",
    "Follow-cam clay spray/dust is a preview composite only and is not a shipped tile."
